## Implementation Details

The implementation follows the official Vercel documentation for Next.js App Router:
- Analytics component is imported from `@vercel/analytics/next`
- Component is placed in the root layout file (`src/app/layout.tsx`)
- Component is positioned inside the `<body>` tag for proper tracking

## Next Steps for Deployment

To enable analytics data collection on Vercel:
1. Navigate to the Analytics tab in your Vercel dashboard
2. Click "Enable" to activate analytics
3. Deploy the application using `vercel deploy`
4. Analytics data will start appearing after users visit the site

